Package: ememax
Type: Package
Title: Bias Reduction Dose-Respose Estimation with Missing Binary
        Response for Emax Model
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Jiangshan Zhang
Maintainer: Jiangshan Zhang <jiszhang@ucdavis.edu>
Description: The functions EmaxEM and EmaxEM_firth fit an Emax model to binary data using maximum likelihood  and EM algorithm with missing data in response. EmaxEM do the EM directly, while EmaxEM_firth is bias reduced model with jeffrey prior peanlized likelihood function.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: brglm2, numDeriv, maxLik, formula.tools, BB, MASS, boot
Suggests: clinDR,rlang
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2025-08-27 21:00:35 UTC; jiang
